<title>USA: UPS to nominate Alden as vice chairman.</title>
<headline>UPS to nominate Alden as vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Parcel Service said on Tuesday it would nominate John Alden as vice chairman of the board at its November board meeting.</p>
<p>Alden currently is senior vice president of business development and has been on the board since 1988. The company was not available to say whether this was a new position.</p>
</text>
